## Core Scope & Constraints (Pakistan-first)
- Currency PKR, distance in km, timezone Asia/Karachi.
- Low-bandwidth/offline: image compression, retries, action queue, cached reads.
- Legal: ShareGo does not handle payments/delivery/courier; users arrange logistics and comply with local laws. Marketplace disclaimer must be visible on relevant screens.
- Security: email OTP -> hashed storage -> JWT (roles: user, admin, ops); owner-only mutations; audit logging; hashed QR/OTP for handovers.
- Escrow only for Feature A (personal shopping/delivery). Marketplace Feature B uses offer/counter-offer, no bidding/auction, no escrow. Meaningful 400/401/403/404 responses.
- Media stored under `./media/` (or MinIO option).

## Architecture Baseline
- Mobile: Flutter app; Dio REST; Riverpod/BLoC; offline queue/retry; image compression; QR scan; GPS capture.
- Backend: FastAPI monolith; SQLite `sharego.db`; Jinja2 admin for ops/KYC/moderation; read-only AI micro-app for FAQs/DB queries.
- Entities: users, trips, travel_proof, requests, bookings, escrow (Feature A), messages, market_listings, offers/counter-offers, meetups, reviews, audit logs.

